    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BE A CAT and SAVE YOUR HUMAN from the GREEBLES!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049450/extras/c0d58ca76570bfca95dc0b4c0eedf1b8.poster.avif?t=1743713388\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049450/extras/c0d58ca76570bfca95dc0b4c0eedf1b8.webm?t=1743713388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049450/extras/c0d58ca76570bfca95dc0b4c0eedf1b8.mp4?t=1743713388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Itty Bitty Toilet Kitty you get to play as a cute feline who must protect their owner from the flesh eating toilet monsters - GREEBLES. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049450/extras/ced29341db06dfd3b9d8a297790af76b.poster.avif?t=1743713388\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049450/extras/ced29341db06dfd3b9d8a297790af76b.webm?t=1743713388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049450/extras/ced29341db06dfd3b9d8a297790af76b.mp4?t=1743713388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chase, jump and slash them down, until there are none left. It's simple but chaotically cute.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049450/extras/7aa3bf4d36360d29c834bde402c81bce.poster.avif?t=1743713388\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049450/extras/7aa3bf4d36360d29c834bde402c81bce.webm?t=1743713388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049450/extras/7aa3bf4d36360d29c834bde402c81bce.mp4?t=1743713388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play  a short story ending with an epic boss fight in which you'll test all your kitty clawing skills.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049450/extras/6e193be8d49115c4f44948675949c9c8.poster.avif?t=1743713388\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049450/extras/6e193be8d49115c4f44948675949c9c8.webm?t=1743713388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049450/extras/6e193be8d49115c4f44948675949c9c8.mp4?t=1743713388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel Art and a Retro soundtrack, Itty-Bitty Toilet Kitty is a micro game with a big kitty bite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049450/extras/c9c3745873d2ebfc83960afe46cb3938.poster.avif?t=1743713388\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049450/extras/c9c3745873d2ebfc83960afe46cb3938.webm?t=1743713388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049450/extras/c9c3745873d2ebfc83960afe46cb3938.mp4?t=1743713388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BE A CAT and SAVE YOUR HUMAN from the GREEBLES!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049450/extras/c0d58ca76570bfca95dc0b4c0eedf1b8.poster.avif?t=1743713388\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049450/extras/c0d58ca76570bfca95dc0b4c0eedf1b8.webm?t=1743713388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049450/extras/c0d58ca76570bfca95dc0b4c0eedf1b8.mp4?t=1743713388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Itty Bitty Toilet Kitty you get to play as a cute feline who must protect their owner from the flesh eating toilet monsters - GREEBLES. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049450/extras/ced29341db06dfd3b9d8a297790af76b.poster.avif?t=1743713388\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049450/extras/ced29341db06dfd3b9d8a297790af76b.webm?t=1743713388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049450/extras/ced29341db06dfd3b9d8a297790af76b.mp4?t=1743713388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chase, jump and slash them down, until there are none left. It's simple but chaotically cute.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049450/extras/7aa3bf4d36360d29c834bde402c81bce.poster.avif?t=1743713388\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049450/extras/7aa3bf4d36360d29c834bde402c81bce.webm?t=1743713388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049450/extras/7aa3bf4d36360d29c834bde402c81bce.mp4?t=1743713388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play  a short story ending with an epic boss fight in which you'll test all your kitty clawing skills.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049450/extras/6e193be8d49115c4f44948675949c9c8.poster.avif?t=1743713388\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049450/extras/6e193be8d49115c4f44948675949c9c8.webm?t=1743713388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049450/extras/6e193be8d49115c4f44948675949c9c8.mp4?t=1743713388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel Art and a Retro soundtrack, Itty-Bitty Toilet Kitty is a micro game with a big kitty bite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049450/extras/c9c3745873d2ebfc83960afe46cb3938.poster.avif?t=1743713388\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049450/extras/c9c3745873d2ebfc83960afe46cb3938.webm?t=1743713388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3049450/extras/c9c3745873d2ebfc839